DeepFilterNet3

The official Rust/WASM runtime is operational with a user-selected external
model. No C port or weight binary from kdrkdrkdr/DeepFilterNet3.c.wasm is
distributed; its own source license was unspecified. Official DeepFilterNet
code is MIT OR Apache-2.0; the model redistribution question remains separate.
See item 10 and docs/deepfilternet3.md.

Test audio

The optionally downloaded reference speech in research/ is for local testing.
It is excluded from Windows builds and version control. NoiseLab does not
grant rights to redistribute that third-party media. Generated synthetic
test fixtures are original test signals, not speech-quality benchmarks.

